      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Hub keeps the Anthropic API key out of its own process environment by using a **local secrets loader** that:\n\n1. **Reads the key at startup** from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file\n2. **Injects it only into child processes** \u2014 specifically the spawned Ingest agent and Query agent processes, immediately before they start\n3. **Never mutates the Hub\u0027s own process environment** \u2014 the key is only present in the short-lived child processes that actually call the Anthropic API\n\nThis design ensures that even if the Hub process is compromised or misbehaves, the credential cannot be leaked simply by inspecting the Hub\u0027s environment variables, since the key never exists there in the first place.",
